@type project
@title Northstar
@summary A redesign of a nonprofit organization's website, making its resources easier to discover and use.

# About

Northstar is a website redesign for a nonprofit organization with a large collection of resources, programs, and educational material.

The project focused on making that information easier to discover and giving visitors clearer paths to the resources most relevant to them.

I simplified the site structure, refined the visual hierarchy, and improved the experience across desktop and mobile devices.

# My Role

I worked on both the design and front-end implementation of the site.

My work included reorganizing content, designing reusable page patterns, and improving accessibility throughout the interface.